 "evidence": "Memory claims flags can be turned on \"per environment without a deploy\". Code shows otherwise: flags.toml has a single [flags] table (no per-env sections, no env-var override), and src/flags.py:4 loads it once at import time. Toggling requires editing flags.toml and restarting/redeploying, and applies globally. The rest (is_on() accessor, kebab-case names, must declare in flags.toml, undeclared -> False silently) is accurate.",
 "source_file": "src/flags.py"
}
